s\nDuring their doctoral years, students will benefit from the following programs:\nPSL interdisciplinary courses: PSL is a strongly interdisciplinary university with special courses that cut across our disciplinary graduate programs and are open to all graduate students;\nPSL innovation and entrepreneurship program for those who are interested in tech transfer from academic labs to economic world\nPSL PhD training\nMore information\nResources for prospective students\nCampus life @PSL\nPSL welcome desk\nContact\nphdtracks@psl.eu\nApply\nMore information (Admissions)\nFind your course\nBy education level\nBy education level\nBachelor's\nMaster's\nPhD\nOther\nBy discipline\nBy discipline\nAnthropology\nArcheology\nArchitecture\nArchives \u2013 Documentation\nArt History\nArts\nAstronomie\nAstrophysics\nBanking - Finance - Insurance\nBiologie\nBiology\nBusiness Administration - Management\nChemistry\nCognitive science\nCommunications - Journalism\nComputer Science\nData Science\nDigital Humanities\nDrama\nEarth sciences\nEarth sciences\nEcology\nEconomics\nEngineering Science\nEntrepreneurship\nFashion and design\nFinance\nGeosciences\nG\u00e9ographie\nG\u00e9ographie politique\nG\u00e9osciences\nHealth - Medecine\nHistory\nHuman Resources\nLanguages\nLaw\nLife Sciences\nLiterature\nManagement\nMarketing\nMathematics\nMechanics and Materials\nM\u00e9decine\nPhilosophy\nPhysics\nPlastic Arts\nPolitical Science\nProgramming\nQuantum engineering\nReligious sciences\nSciences du climat\nSocial Science\nSociology\nSpace Science\nSustainable development\nSearch\nPSL in international rankings\nRead more\nStudent stories\nRead more\nMain navigation\nUniversity\nAbout us\nSchools\nInternational rankings\nOrganization\nNews\nPariSant\u00e9 Campus\nInvestments for the Future Program\nMedia Relations and Communications\nJoin us\nThe PSL Foundation\nEducation\nFind your curriculum\nAdmissions\nPSL voices : by students, for students\nInternational students\nCustomise your courses\n